    {
      "id": "claim_ede192a8583540abadd8b011887bde39",
      "statement": "deploy-inputs.json declares a gatekeeper's user-supplied inputs (each becoming a pass-through secret in the release manifest); omitting it defaults to CLIENT_ID/CLIENT_SECRET secret inputs, so gatekeepers taking no third-party OAuth app credentials must be added to NO_DEFAULT_CRED_INPUTS in scripts/release/manifest-lib.ts — otherwise the deploy wizard blocks Install on unfilled secret inputs and the gatekeeper is uninstallable; NOT_INSTALLABLE marks packages that cannot run on customer instances (e.g. email needs a zone).",
